","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"879b16cac6d85aab22d712818d994c66c0ba0cc3","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/commits/879b16cac6d85aab22d712818d994c66c0ba0cc3","created_at":"2026-01-27T09:07:49Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"b066f0594528cbe344b9ae8eb93d0b23876b5ca6","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGIwNjZmMDU5NDUyOGNiZTM0NGI5YWU4ZWI5M2QwYjIzODc2YjVjYTY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b066f0594528cbe344b9ae8eb93d0b23876b5ca6","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b066f0594528cbe344b9ae8eb93d0b23876b5ca6","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-26T10:58:05Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T08:27:03Z"},"tree":{"sha":"74c74fa2ab9d82c4c8560232c51e8765bce4c1c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/74c74fa2ab9d82c4c8560232c51e8765bce4c1c5"},"message":"state: fix nil pointer panic when re-registering tagged node without user\n\nWhen a node was registered with a tags-only PreAuthKey (no user\nassociated), the node had User=nil and UserID=nil. When attempting to\nre-register this node to a different user via HandleNodeFromAuthPath,\ntwo issues occurred:\n\n1. The code called oldUser.Name() without checking if oldUser was valid,\n   causing a nil pointer dereference panic.\n\n2. The existing node lookup logic didn't find the tagged node because it\n   searched by (machineKey, userID), but tagged nodes have no userID.\n   This caused a new node to be created instead of updating the existing\n   tagged node.\n\nFix this by restructuring HandleNodeFromAuthPath to:\n1. First check if a node exists for the same user (existing behavior)\n2. If not found, check if an existing TAGGED node exists with the same\n   machine key (regardless of userID)\n3. If a tagged node exists, UPDATE it to convert from tagged to\n   user-owned (preserving the node ID)\n4. Only create a new node if the existing node is user-owned by a\n   different user\n\nThis ensures consistent behavior between:\n- personal → tagged → personal (same node, same owner)\n- tagged (no user) → personal (same node, new owner)\n\nAdd a test that reproduces the panic and conversion scenario by:\n1. Creating a tags-only PreAuthKey (no user)\n2. Registering a node with that key\n3. Re-registering the same machine to a different user\n4. Verifying the node ID stays the same (conversion, not creation)\n\nFixes #3038","parents":[{"sha":"46daa659e23278751063001a402f308f35693dc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/46daa659e23278751063001a402f308f35693dc3","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/46daa659e23278751063001a402f308f35693dc3"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":22338754091,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887l0PjHzwAAAAUzflYr","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/22338754091","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"b066f0594528cbe344b9ae8eb93d0b23876b5ca6","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/commits/b066f0594528cbe344b9ae8eb93d0b23876b5ca6","created_at":"2026-01-28T08:27:10Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":22347873111,"node_id":"RTE_lADOEFLz887l0PjHzwAAAAU0CXtX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/22347873111","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"renamed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-01-28T14:37:37Z","rename":{"from":"Fix nil pointer panic when re-registering tagged node without user","to":"Fix node re-registration and tag conversion issues"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":22347939517,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887l0PjHzwAAAAU0Cn69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/22347939517","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"794b20b78b11e62cbd1e3872c66f9b1c2854a01d","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/commits/794b20b78b11e62cbd1e3872c66f9b1c2854a01d","created_at":"2026-01-28T14:40:10Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"0694caf4d2b738ef2819001d0c7e3bad4bc8c171","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDA2OTRjYWY0ZDJiNzM4ZWYyODE5MDAxZDBjN2UzYmFkNGJjOGMxNzE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/0694caf4d2b738ef2819001d0c7e3bad4bc8c171","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/0694caf4d2b738ef2819001d0c7e3bad4bc8c171","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T10:30:48Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T15:34:18Z"},"tree":{"sha":"7abc1b737c8dc82b8102485678623b68c9ee197f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/7abc1b737c8dc82b8102485678623b68c9ee197f"},"message":"state: refactor HandleNodeFromAuthPath for clarity\n\nReorganize HandleNodeFromAuthPath (~300 lines) into a cleaner structure\nwith named conditions and extracted helper functions.\n\nChanges:\n- Add authNodeUpdateParams struct for shared update logic\n- Extract applyAuthNodeUpdate for common reauth/convert operations\n- Extract reauthExistingNode and convertTaggedNodeToUser handlers\n- Extract createNewNodeFromAuth for new node creation\n- Use named boolean conditions (nodeExistsForSameUser, existingNodeIsTagged,\n  existingNodeOwnedByOtherUser) instead of compound if conditions\n- Create logger with common fields (registration_id, user.name, machine.key,\n  method) to reduce log statement verbosity\n\nUpdates #3038","parents":[{"sha":"b066f0594528cbe344b9ae8eb93d0b23876b5ca6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b066f0594528cbe344b9ae8eb93d0b23876b5ca6","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b066f0594528cbe344b9ae8eb93d0b23876b5ca6"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"7b6990f63e72b0c8882df94c92b0e0b71edc0faa","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDdiNjk5MGY2M2U3MmIwYzg4ODJkZjk0YzkyYjBlMGI3MWVkYzBmYWE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/7b6990f63e72b0c8882df94c92b0e0b71edc0faa","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/7b6990f63e72b0c8882df94c92b0e0b71edc0faa","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T14:33:46Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T15:34:18Z"},"tree":{"sha":"d7446237d26a7693acd27a8d6f87e50474a10cad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/d7446237d26a7693acd27a8d6f87e50474a10cad"},"message":"state: fix expiry handling during node tag conversion\n\nPreviously, expiry handling ran BEFORE processReauthTags(), using the\nold tagged status to determine whether to set/clear expiry. This caused:\n\n- Personal → Tagged: Expiry remained set (should be cleared to nil)\n- Tagged → Personal: Expiry remained nil (should be set from client)\n\nMove expiry handling after tag processing and handle all four transition\ncases based on the new tagged status:\n\n- Tagged → Personal: Set expiry from client request\n- Personal → Tagged: Clear expiry (tagged nodes don't expire)\n- Personal → Personal: Update expiry from client\n- Tagged → Tagged: Keep existing nil expiry\n\nFixes #3048","parents":[{"sha":"0694caf4d2b738ef2819001d0c7e3bad4bc8c171","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/0694caf4d2b738ef2819001d0c7e3bad4bc8c171","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/0694caf4d2b738ef2819001d0c7e3bad4bc8c171"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"32203accbe65bc8699a3b901aacde808c569d489","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDMyMjAzYWNjYmU2NWJjODY5OWEzYjkwMWFhY2RlODA4YzU2OWQ0ODk","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/32203accbe65bc8699a3b901aacde808c569d489","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/32203accbe65bc8699a3b901aacde808c569d489","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T15:09:27Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T15:34:18Z"},"tree":{"sha":"a84d40a592dea5769d12dbf38c7670d3fed9010c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/a84d40a592dea5769d12dbf38c7670d3fed9010c"},"message":"state: validate tags before UpdateNode to ensure consistency\n\nMove tag validation before the UpdateNode callback in applyAuthNodeUpdate.\nPreviously, tag validation happened inside the callback, and the error\ncheck occurred after UpdateNode had already committed changes to the\nNodeStore. This left the NodeStore in an inconsistent state when tags\nwere rejected.\n\nNow validation happens first, and UpdateNode is only called when we know\nthe operation will succeed. This follows the principle that UpdateNode\nshould only be called when we have all information and are ready to commit.\n\nAlso extract validateRequestTags as a reusable function and use it in\ncreateAndSaveNewNode to deduplicate the tag validation logic.\n\nUpdates #3038\nUpdates #3048","parents":[{"sha":"7b6990f63e72b0c8882df94c92b0e0b71edc0faa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/7b6990f63e72b0c8882df94c92b0e0b71edc0faa","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/7b6990f63e72b0c8882df94c92b0e0b71edc0faa"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"2cbbfc43199bbc7584f823766b715b59ad8b0035","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDJjYmJmYzQzMTk5YmJjNzU4NGY4MjM3NjZiNzE1YjU5YWQ4YjAwMzU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2cbbfc43199bbc7584f823766b715b59ad8b0035","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2cbbfc43199bbc7584f823766b715b59ad8b0035","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T15:25:03Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-01-28T15:34:18Z"},"tree":{"sha":"0a4504dfbd979306e9759bd10a83fac118d47ae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/0a4504dfbd979306e9759bd10a83fac118d47ae8"},"message":"state: inline reauthExistingNode and convertTaggedNodeToUser\n\nThese were thin wrappers around applyAuthNodeUpdate that only added\nlogging. Move the logging into applyAuthNodeUpdate and call it directly\nfrom HandleNodeFromAuthPath.\n\nThis simplifies the code structure without changing behavior.\n\nUpdates #3038","parents":[{"sha":"32203accbe65bc8699a3b901aacde808c569d489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/32203accbe65bc8699a3b901aacde808c569d489","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/32203accbe65bc8699a3b901aacde808c569d489"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":3731867057,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOEFLz887eb8Wx","user":{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Following the steps to reproduce in #3038:\n\n1. Create a tagged preauthkey: `headscale preauthkeys create --tags tag:some`\n2. Register: `tailscale up --login-server=https://headscale.example.com --auth-key hskey-auth-…`\n3. Create a headscale user: `headscale user create alice`\n4. Force reauth: `tailscale up --login-server=https://headscale.example.com --advertise-tags= --force-reauth`\n5. Crash: `headscale nodes register --user alice --key …`\n\nyields another crash:\n\n```\n2026-01-31T07:54:49+01:00 INF Starting node registration using key: hRn7KSd2O2EhpBZZaOY2AxIh\n2026-01-31T07:54:58+01:00 INF Converting tagged node to user-owned node machine.key=[rhXex] method=cli node.id=1 node.name=n1 old.tags=[\"tag:some\"] registration_id=hRn7KSd2O2EhpBZZaOY2AxIh user.name=alice\n2026-01-31T07:54:58+01:00 INF Reauth: removing all tags, returning node ownership to user node.id=1 node.name=n1 removed.tags=[\"tag:some\"] user.name=alice was.authkey.tagged=true\n2026-01-31T07:54:59+01:00 INF Node registered successfully hostname=n1 node_id=1 registration_key=hskey-reg-pd8MzrCIcKUPVBqkr-RPkW33SkfVfpghpVeAJ4QaYYphltrM3fZA-S7SaymJTEwh\n2026-01-31T07:54:59+01:00 INF Node connected node.id=1 node.name=n1\n2026-01-31T07:54:59+01:00 INF hscontrol/poll.go:332 > node has connected, mapSession: 0xc0004625a0, chan: 0xc0001ffab0 node.id=1 node.name=n1 omitPeers=false stream=true\npanic: runtime error: invalid memory address or nil pointer dereference\n[signal SIGSEGV: segmentation violation code=0x1 addr=0x0 pc=0x5555564e4a0a]\n\ngoroutine 29 [running]:\ngithub.com/juanfont/headscale/hscontrol/types.UserView.Model(...)\n        /home/ansible/headscale/hscontrol/types/types_view.go:92\ngithub.com/juanfont/headscale/hscontrol/mapper.generateUserProfiles({0xc0003f3560?}, {{0x0?, 0x1?, 0xe?}})\n        /home/ansible/headscale/hscontrol/mapper/mapper.go:80 +0x14a\ngithub.com/juanfont/headscale/hscontrol/mapper.(*MapResponseBuilder).WithUserProfiles(0xc000605b60, {{0x0?, 0x0?, 0x555557ab0140?}})\n        /home/ansible/headscale/hscontrol/mapper/builder.go:169 +0x58\ngithub.com/juanfont/headscale/hscontrol/mapper.(*mapper).buildFromChange(0xc0003a7000, 0x1, 0x83, 0x0?)\n        /home/ansible/headscale/hscontrol/mapper/mapper.go:276 +0x41c\ngithub.com/juanfont/headscale/hscontrol/mapper.generateMapResponse({0x555557ac2240, 0xc0007925a0}, 0xc0003a7000, {{0x555556c23fbc, 0x10}, 0x1, 0x0, 0x1, 0x1, 0x1, ...})\n        /home/ansible/headscale/hscontrol/mapper/batcher.go:125 +0x315\ngithub.com/juanfont/headscale/hscontrol/mapper.(*LockFreeBatcher).worker(0xc00047b180, 0x1)\n        /home/ansible/headscale/hscontrol/mapper/batcher_lockfree.go:218 +0x1a5\ncreated by github.com/juanfont/headscale/hscontrol/mapper.(*LockFreeBatcher).doWork in goroutine 85\n        /home/ansible/headscale/hscontrol/mapper/batcher_lockfree.go:176 +0x58\n```\n\nThe conversion itself seems to be complete as both Headscale and Tailscale show `alice` as the owner of the device.","commit_id":"4dbc58f970272584a7d77b1db39424ce005d1538","state":"changes_requested","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3046#pullrequestreview-3731867057","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3046","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3046#pullrequestreview-3731867057"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3046"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-31T06:57:54Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T06:57:54Z","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","event":"reviewed"},{"sha":"80a34ec3c1c97ffde11ce75fcf96b35c02a308c3","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDgwYTM0ZWMzYzFjOTdmZmRlMTFjZTc1ZmNmOTZiMzVjMDJhMzA4YzM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/80a34ec3c1c97ffde11ce75fcf96b35c02a308c3","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/80a34ec3c1c97ffde11ce75fcf96b35c02a308c3","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-02T14:52:47Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-02T14:52:47Z"},"tree":{"sha":"4349612f26193674e4eca56b7d6c3ccfbccd6ce4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/4349612f26193674e4eca56b7d6c3ccfbccd6ce4"},"message":"state: set User pointer during tagged→user-owned conversion\n\nprocessReauthTags sets UserID when converting a tagged node to\nuser-owned, but does not set the User pointer. When the node was\nregistered with a tags-only PreAuthKey (User: nil), the in-memory\nNodeStore cache holds a node with User=nil. The mapper's\ngenerateUserProfiles then calls node.Owner().Model().ID, which\ndereferences the nil pointer and panics.\n\nSet node.User alongside node.UserID in processReauthTags. Also add\ndefensive nil checks in generateUserProfiles to gracefully handle\nnodes with invalid owners rather than panicking.\n\nFixes #3038","parents":[{"sha":"2cbbfc43199bbc7584f823766b715b59ad8b0035","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2cbbfc43199bbc7584f823766b715b59ad8b0035","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2cbbfc43199bbc7584f823766b715b59ad8b0035"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"ea53078dde76cbd0b90cd3ccb88f032e7da06575","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGVhNTMwNzhkZGU3NmNiZDBiOTBjZDNjY2I4OGYwMzJlN2RhMDY1NzU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/ea53078dde76cbd0b90cd3ccb88f032e7da06575","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/ea53078dde76cbd0b90cd3ccb88f032e7da06575","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-02T14:53:27Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-02T14:53:27Z"},"tree":{"sha":"531cc9f5507ba91748e788a60f0015381ee1105a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/531cc9f5507ba91748e788a60f0015381ee1105a"},"message":"integration: add test for tagged→user-owned conversion panic\n\nAdd TestTagsAuthKeyConvertToUserViaCLIRegister that reproduces the\nexact panic from #3038: register a node with a tags-only PreAuthKey\n(no user), force reauth with empty tags, then register via CLI with\na user. The mapper panics on node.Owner().Model().ID when User is nil.\n\nThe critical detail is using a tags-only PreAuthKey (User: nil). When\nthe key is created under a user, the node inherits the User pointer\nfrom createAndSaveNewNode and the bug is masked.\n\nAlso add Owner() validity assertions to the existing unit test\nTestTaggedNodeWithoutUserToDifferentUser to catch the nil pointer\nat the unit test level.\n\nUpdates #3038","parents":[{"sha":"80a34ec3c1c97ffde11ce75fcf96b35c02a308c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/80a34ec3c1c97ffde11ce75fcf96b35c02a308c3","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/80a34ec3c1c97ffde11ce75fcf96b35c02a308c3"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":22498059183,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887l0PjHzwAAAAU8_SOv","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/22498059183","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"ea53078dde76cbd0b90cd3ccb88f032e7da06575","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/commits/ea53078dde76cbd0b90cd3ccb88f032e7da06575","created_at":"2026-02-